SUMMARY:Lavender Bloom Fest at Bees N Blooms
DESCRIPTION:Lavender Bloom Fest 2026 at Bees N Blooms runs during peak bloom season\, offering a vibrant farm experience centered around the Lavender Labyrinth and blooming fields in full color.    The festival takes place May 23–July 12 on Saturdays and Sundays from 10 AM–4 PM\, with additional evening hours May 29 and every Friday in June from 6 PM–9 PM. Reservations are required to ensure a comfortable guest experience.    Guests can enjoy self-guided farm access\, a Lavender Labyrinth walk\, and seasonal blooms ranging from soft purples to pinks and whites\, depending on variety and weather. Admission includes a farm map and full grounds access\, with kids 12 and under free with an adult. Select evenings feature live jazz performances.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/lavender-bloom-fest-at-bees-n-blooms/
LOCATION:3883 Petaluma Hill Road, Santa Rosa, CA, 95404, United States
CATEGORIES:Fairs & Festivals,Family Friendly,Live Music,Music,Performing Arts,Sonoma County
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/05/23223430/2026LavenderSunsetEveningsGeneralPostWebsiteV1.png
END:VEVENT
