SUMMARY:Clover Sonoma Ice Cream Sampling at SOMO Village
DESCRIPTION:Refuel and cool off at Sonoma County Pedal Fest with a Clover Sonoma ice cream sampling. Festivalgoers can enjoy complimentary samples of Clover Sonoma’s new ice cream while taking a break from the day’s rides and activities. Be sure to stop by and meet Clo the Cow mascot for a fun photo opportunity during this lively\, community-focused cycling event.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/clover-sonoma-ice-cream-sampling-at-somo-village/
