SUMMARY:Americana Afternoon at The California Theatre
DESCRIPTION:This monthly concert series at The California Theatre of Santa Rosa showcases the best of Sonoma County’s folk\, bluegrass\, and Americana music\, offering an easygoing afternoon of live performances\, community connection\, and great vibes.    Enjoy a special performance by Solid Air Trio\, joined by country-rock legend Gene Parsons of The Byrds and Flying Burrito Brothers. Celebrating their new album The West is on Fire\, the group blends folk-rock\, Americana\, Cajun\, and gospel blues into a dynamic set of originals and danceable favorites.    Doors open at 12:30 PM\, with the show beginning at 1:00 PM. Tickets are available in advance or at the door.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/americana-afternoon-at-the-california-theatre-2/
LOCATION:528 7th Street, Santa Rosa, CA, 95401
CATEGORIES:Family Friendly,Live Music,Music,Performing Arts,Sonoma County
