SUMMARY:PetNat Release Party at Keller Estate Winery
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the release of a winery’s first-ever PetNat during a festive afternoon of wine\, music\, and seasonal experiences in a newly unveiled garden space nestled within the olive grove. This vibrant bottle-fermented wine was crafted for sharing and celebrating the simple pleasures of the season.    Guests can enjoy wine tastings\, seasonal food pairings\, live music\, and hands-on floral design activities in an intimate outdoor setting designed for gathering and relaxation. This special event offers a lively way to experience the new release alongside fresh flavors\, beautiful surroundings\, and community connection.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/petnat-release-party-at-keller-estate-winery/
LOCATION:5875 Lakeville Highway, Petaluma, 94954, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebration,Dining,Drink,Food,Food & Wine,Food and Wine Pairing,Music,Sonoma County,Wine,Wine Tasting
